:2.4.3/gradle/generateDynamicAccessCoverageReport-2026-10-05T22-26-03-771195Z.log`\n- `stats/net.minidev/accessors-smart/2.4.3/execution-metrics.json`\n\nManual next steps:\n1. Confirm whether `2.4.3` should be treated as an unresolvable/skipped version and move compatibility testing to the next version with a published binary JAR.\n2. If `2.4.3` must remain supported, make the source-built JAR discoverable by the harness’s library-JAR, JaCoCo, and stats tasks.\n3. Re-run the coordinate-scoped metadata, coverage, stats, JVM, and Native Image gates before retaining the generated index and metadata changes.", "textSignature": "{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_090381022292ac60016ac4298f533c87d0a17b27362ec809b6\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}], "api": "openai-codex-responses", "provider": "openai-codex", "model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "usage": {"input": 23867, "output": 911, "cacheRead": 68736, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 410, "totalTokens": 93514, "cost": {"input": 0.095468, "output": 0.01822, "cacheRead": 0.027494400000000002, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.14118239999999999}}, "stopReason": "stop", "timestamp": 1791240581950, "responseId": "resp_090381022292ac60016ac42986dfac87d0825e454e7772c324", "rawStopReason": "completed"}, "toolResults": []}
